research/audit/wave12-dispatch/certifier-a6-cex-dini-needs-monotonicity-r2.log:7595:research/audit/wave12-dispatch/certifier-a6-rem-rn-conventions-and-scope-r3.log:3917:research/audit/wave12-finalize-a6.mjs-283-  `The initial URL table had two redundant 404 endpoints. Alpha removed the Lebl draft URL from 28 items and the KTH URL from two items; every item retained a live supporting source. The final sweep is 44/44 live. The repair ledger is \`research/audit/wave12-published-repairs.md\`.\n\n` +
