research/audit/wave12-dispatch/certifier-a6-cex-dini-needs-monotonicity-r2.log-7598-research/audit/wave12-dispatch/certifier-a6-rem-rn-conventions-and-scope-r3.log-3920-research/audit/wave12-finalize-a6.mjs-286-  `All 48 contracts carry current-hash risk reviews. The full ${manifest.edges.length}-edge relationship census is exact. In particular the frozen Wave12→Wave11 barrier is 29/29 exact with zero stale, stronger, or misdirected edges. All ${impact.required_review.length} impact consumers remain licensed; no consumer repair was required.\n\n` +
